[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727259150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104211#issuecomment-2727259150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104211","id":2727259150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ijqwO","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T08:19:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T08:22:18Z","body":"> the adaptive icon looks bigger then the actual size.\n\nI'm not sure what you mean by this. Can you show comparison of expected vs actual icon? I exported the MRP and icon looked good to me.\n\nAlso read: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/export/exporting_for_android.html#providing-launcher-icons\n\n> The most important adaptive icon design rule is to have your icon critical elements inside the safe zone: a centered circle with a diameter of 66dp (264 pixels on xxxhdpi) to avoid being clipped by the launcher.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727259150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727382561","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104211#issuecomment-2727382561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104211","id":2727382561,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikI4h","user":{"login":"llama-nl","id":94882246,"node_id":"U_kgDOBafJxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94882246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl","html_url":"https://github.com/llama-nl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T12:56:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T12:56:35Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 I upgraded the description please check. the difference may not clear, look at the corner distance. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727382561/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727468329","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104211#issuecomment-2727468329","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104211","id":2727468329,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikd0p","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T14:23:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T14:23:28Z","body":"Ah! You mean the icon appears slightly closer to the edges in the final version? That's expected behavior, launchers apply a mask to icons with some padding from the sides.\n\nThis is why it's important to keep key elements within the safe zone. I recommend reading [this article](https://medium.com/google-design/designing-adaptive-icons-515af294c783), which explains designing icons perfectly. It's also mentioned in the documentation page I shared in my last comment.\n\nThe image from artical illustrates this clearly. The icon itself is designed at `108dp x 108dp`, but after masking, it's displayed as `72dp x 72dp`.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7e697e3-9108-4ebd-bda9-4f7c867ad8fc)\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727468329/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]